questions.explanation:
Stacks use a first in, last out protocol for accessing data. 
s.push(“one”); 
one 
s.push(“two”); 
one two 
s.push(“two”); 
one two two 
s.pop(); 
one two 
s.push(“three”); 
one two three 
s.push(“four”); 
one two three four 
Elements are popped out from right to left.

